<title>SRI LANKA: Cricket-Sri Lanka 349 v Zimbabwe in first innings.</title>
<headline>Cricket-Sri Lanka 349 v Zimbabwe in first innings.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka were 349 at the end of their first innings on the second day of the first cricket test against Zimbabwe on Thursday.</p>
</text>
